### Commit messages.

## Which input or operation was refused: the first words of the error.

message-what-trailer = trailer
message-what-message = message
message-what-sign-off = sign off

## Why.

# The key that was given, quoted.
message-not-trailer-key = { $key } is not a trailer key: letters, digits and hyphens, like Reviewed-by
message-needs-value = { $key } needs a value
message-value-one-line = the value of { $key } must be one line
message-no-nul = a commit message has no NUL in it
message-no-identity = git has no name and email to sign off with; set user.name and user.email
